      "explanation": "Held: the 24-hour SO2 standard applicable in 2019 was 80 µg/m³, equivalent to 0.080 mg/m³, under the 2009 National Ambient Air Quality Standards. Page 9 actually prints mg/m³ in every choice, so none is correct as written; selecting 80 would require an explicit unit correction (standard: https://leap.unep.org/en/akn/in/act/2009/b-29016-20-90-pci-l/eng%402009-11-18).",
